# Line endings
#
# This is a Windows-only project and its content is consistently CRLF.
# Git is told to leave line endings exactly as they are: normalising them
# would rewrite every file the first time it is touched, and reassign the
# blame for fifteen years of history to whoever changed one line.

* -text

# Binary: never diffed, never converted
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.JPG    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.bmp    binary
*.ico    binary
*.chm    binary
*.pdf    binary
*.zip    binary
*.exe    binary
*.dll    binary
*.lib    binary
*.aps    binary
*.pfb    binary